    {
      "id": "FC-STU-002",
      "title": "the hold is a next step: a gated task is answered with trust-task-next-step naming the step-up as what it expects, not with an error (SPEC 8.6), and nothing has run yet",
      "spec": [
        "SPEC.md 8.6 (a hold is a next step)",
        "SPEC.md 8.6 (a consumer holding a task MUST answer with a next step and MUST NOT answer with taskFailed, permissionDenied or any other error whose extended code or details says the task is held)",
        "TF specs/auth/step-up/approve-response/0.7/spec.md",
        "docs/26-paired-ceremonies.md section 4"
      ],
